      "content": "but that's the thing. there aren't any other mountains. i gave everything to this one. i spent my youth, my relationships, my sanity just to get here. and now that the mission is over, i just see the end of the road. it feels like i've completed the purpose of my life, and now i'm just... lingering. does it ever stop feeling like you're just waiting for something that isn't coming?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
